  <item>
    <title>云南EP02 | 昆明 · 跑在翠湖每一圈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad1e5d4641ef406308ca36d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad1e5d4641ef406308ca36d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“没有理想的人不伤心？”</span></p><p><span>“第一次马拉松站台，却要睡公园长椅？”</span></p><p><span>“从一个人到一群人，昆明如何留住跑者？”</span></p><p><span>“当速度没有终点，怎样才算真正的强大？”</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期我们和配速员【跑者·毛文章】一起</span></p><p><span>从昆明老街的忠爱坊出发</span></p><p><span>途经正义路、抗战胜利纪念堂、翠湖、云南大学</span></p><p><span>最后抵达国立西南联合大学旧址</span></p><p><span>以【7分配】，跑过6.1公里</span></p><p><span>听小毛讲述那些关于梦想、爱情、友情与昆明的故事</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyE-nosXo-ibTgCg6i_ZD3Qta7r.jpg"><p><a href="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=edhNxouF%2BiDp%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D" data-url="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=edhNxouF%2BiDp%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D"><strong><span>点击将轨迹文件导入手表</span></strong></a></p><p><strong><span>收听指南：</span></strong></p><p><u><span>这是一档为【边跑边听】而设计的播客</span></u></p><p><u><span>用声音为跑者导航，让故事与脚步同频</span></u></p><p><u><span>1、来到起点，戴上耳机</span></u></p><p><u><span>2、找到配速，欢迎使用倍速功能调节</span></u></p><p><u><span>3、若遇到红灯或需要休息，请暂停播放</span></u></p><p><u><span>4、本条路线经过两所大学，请随身携带身份证（或现场扫码预约入校）</span></u></p><p><u><span>5、建议上午体验，人流更少，跑得更畅快</span></u></p><p><u><span>6、将轨迹文件导入运动手表，可以最大限度避免跑错</span></u></p><p><strong><span>本期概览：</span></strong></p><p><span>距离：6.1 KM</span></p><p><span>配速：7′00″/KM</span></p><p><span>爬升：约50 M</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 跑前热身：收听及跑步提醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 跑步起点：忠爱坊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 昆明老街：一座城市慢慢醒来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 抗战胜利纪念堂：滇越铁路、滇缅公路与春城往事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 昆明人为什么这么「Zha Jin」？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 翠湖生态廊道：从老街跑进昆明心脏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a> 翠湖一圈2公里，跑步从这儿开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 一首歌，决定辞职跑步</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1253">20:53</a> 全职跑者的生存账</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a> 第一次站台，也第一次睡公园长椅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a> 十个人，一间房，小毛的昆明「竹青庄」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2139">35:39</a> 云南大学，关于爱情的记忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2223">37:03</a> 在初跑者身上，找回跑步初心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">38:52</a> 21天马拉松训练营，只做一名跑者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 比跑得快更重要的，是成为强者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">42:09</a> 昆明人，自有跑步基因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2695">44:55</a> 西南联大旧址：“云南人都是家乡宝”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2762">46:02</a> 跑步终点：西南联大博物馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2794">46:34</a> 跑后拉伸：数完68个花坛，跑完人生首半马</span></p><p><strong><span>跑者互动：</span></strong></p><p><span>🕐你为跑步做过最疯狂的一件事是什么？我们将抽取5位留言，送出限量On昂跑 鞋袋1个。</span></p><p><strong><span>制作团队：</span></strong></p><p><span>制作人&amp;主持人：刘易非，《鹰眼时间》主播</span></p><p><span>后期：幸倍</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg4Mlr3YOBwDnp-WzcgAEA80EL_P.jpg"><p><br><br></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/69158578d3a3470555363209/lqygllmVQE2jV20EozjlW3GutW1F.m4a" length="49207334" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlhU6414-63TacDJ713aJ1d4kCA2.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>云南EP01｜丽江 · 跑者李健的第二个家</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad1d732641ef406308c9a05</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad1d732641ef406308c9a05</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“为什么「中国的肯尼亚」是丽江？”</span></p><p><span>“从首马403到冲击210，要跑多远？”</span></p><p><span>“努力在丽江不稀奇，跑步还有什么值得追逐？”</span></p><p><span>“当远方成了故乡，是什么让跑者一次次回来？”</span><br></p><p><span>本期，我们和配速员</span><strong><span>【昂跑签约运动员·李健】</span></strong><span>一起</span></p><p><span>从中济海公园东二门出发</span></p><p><span>环中济海，途经青龙路、丽江市体育中心、雪山路</span></p><p><span>最后抵达丽江的“跑者食堂”</span></p><p><span>用【5分配】跑进另一种丽江</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs5awY3s2qZwfh3QcgpyuSghw43f.jpg"><p><a href="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=rp7xlTZSgT7p%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D" data-url="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=rp7xlTZSgT7p%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D"><strong><span>点击将轨迹文件导入手表</span></strong></a></p><p><strong><span>收听指南：</span></strong></p><p><u><span>这是一档为【边跑边听】而设计的播客</span></u></p><p><u><span>用声音为跑者导航，让故事与脚步同频</span></u></p><p><u><span>1、来到起点，戴上耳机</span></u></p><p><u><span>2、找到配速，欢迎使用倍速功能调节</span></u></p><p><u><span>3、若遇到红灯或需要休息，请暂停播放</span></u></p><p><u><span>4、建议早上或者工作日体验，人流更少，跑得更畅快</span></u></p><p><u><span>5、将轨迹文件导入运动手表，可以最大限度避免跑错</span></u></p><p><strong><span>本期概览：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>距离：11.4 KM</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>配速：5′00″/KM</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 跑前热身：收听及跑步提醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 跑步起点：中济海</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> 从房地产、跑步编辑到全职运动员</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 24岁，跑步才刚开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 要不要把一切都押在跑步上？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> “借道训练”，丽江的跑者优先</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 跑步的才华，究竟是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">16:48</a> 丽江跑者：专业队、训练营与“散养”选手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> “中国的肯尼亚”是丽江？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> 成为职业运动员，是每一天的事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a> “一切取决于审美”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 青龙路：强度、雪山、日复一日</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 蛋蛋帮：跑步是件快乐的事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> “宁愿要一个王，不要四个2”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2489">41:29</a> 马拉松的美，是真实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2623">43:43</a> 雪山下的操场：是异乡，也是故乡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2771">46:11</a> 在丽江，努力是最平常的一件事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a> 跑进210，然后呢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3346">55:46</a> 在“跑者食堂”，丽江的另一群候鸟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3551">59:11</a> 跑后拉伸：跑在玉龙雪山和文笔峰之间</span></p><p><strong><span>跑者互动：</span></strong></p><p><span>🕐你的跑步“自留地”是哪里？我们将抽取3位留言，送出限量On昂跑 鞋包1个。</span></p><p><strong><span>制作团队：</span></strong></p><p><span>制作人&amp;主持人：刘易非，《鹰眼时间》主播</span></p><p><span>后期：幸倍</span></p><p><strong><span>致谢：</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg4Mlr3YOBwDnp-WzcgAEA80EL_P.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/69158578d3a3470555363209/lhYYh9L2arZAnh1leirGUDEERDDh.m4a" length="61097881" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlhU6414-63TacDJ713aJ1d4kCA2.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>深圳EP03 | 福田·城市折叠</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b7b7d6caaea1fb3b8a31d9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b7b7d6caaea1fb3b8a31d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Mar 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“什么样的路，才算好跑？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“深圳真的毫无历史吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“如果选择了另一种规划方案，这座城市会是什么样子？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们和配速员【建筑师·宇豪】一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>从深圳海关出发</span></p><span></span><p><span>途径深南大道、莲花山公园、市民中心、福田河、岗厦村</span></p><span></span><p><span>抵达岗厦北地铁站11出口</span></p><span></span><p><span>用【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">6:30</a>”配速】，从跑者视角观察城市肌理</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2QUs43ab8IYzeBFyNnSG2jLcnx.png"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://www.2bulu.com/share/share_track.htm?trackId=jo0ItZkM473p%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D" data-url="https://www.2bulu.com/share/share_track.htm?trackId=jo0ItZkM473p%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D"><strong><span>点击将轨迹文件导入手表</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听指南：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这是一档为【边跑边听】而设计的播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>用声音为跑者导航，让故事与脚步同频</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 来到起点，戴上耳机</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 找到配速，欢迎使用倍速功能调节</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 若遇到红灯或需要休息，请暂停播放</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 建议早上或者工作日体验，人流更少，跑得更畅快</span></p><span></span><p><span>5.将轨迹文件导入运动手表，可以最大限度避免跑错</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期概览：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>距离：7.8KM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>配速：6′30″/KM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 跑前热身：收听及跑步提醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 跑步起点：深圳海关大楼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 深圳有历史，只是没有城市历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> 水晶岛：市中心的疯狂设想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> 深圳的现代化想象：一路向西、填海造陆、向上发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 莲花山公园：花园城市的痕迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> 市民中心：跑在中轴线上，就像走红毯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1432">23:52</a> 如果选择了另一种城市设计方案，深圳现在会是怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a> 跑者看城市：慢交通友好的城市，是什么样子的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">33:51</a> 华强北：“深圳神话”诞生之地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2197">36:37</a> 福田河绿道：山海连城，是一个动词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2418">40:18</a> 什么路是“好跑”的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a> 在福华路天桥，看城市折叠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2881">48:01</a> 岗厦村：在当下的深圳，城中村依然有意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3172">52:52</a> 跑步终点：岗厦北地铁站11号口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3204">53:24</a> 跑后拉伸：宇豪的跑步故事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>跑者互动：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你喜欢在城市的哪些地方跑步？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作团队：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>制作人&amp;主持人：刘易非，《鹰眼时间》主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：幸倍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FouJ_WUuY77_ggHtKP5LvHFgEr9y.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/69158578d3a3470555363209/lnEyhHDAtsUK_rJOVNsWDeesirdC.m4a" length="55019309" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlhU6414-63TacDJ713aJ1d4kCA2.jpg"/>
