  <item>
    <title>深圳EP02丨深圳湾·借路飞鸟</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69aea6f5275b0687043c5cda</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69aea6f5275b0687043c5cda</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Mar 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“深圳湾为什么能吸引十万只候鸟？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“用另一种速度观察，跑者熟悉的路线还有哪些新发现？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“崇拜科技的时代，人为什么更爱观察自然？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们和配速员【自然写作者·任宁】一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>从红树林海滨生态公园出发</span></p><span></span><p><span>沿深圳湾公园，途径海韵园、小沙山、流花山</span></p><span></span><p><span>抵达深圳人才公园</span></p><span></span><p><span>用【7分配】，来一次亲近自然的观察跑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpNzRz0TpWr9nwp7yzb_WyyEJLNm.png"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://www.2bulu.com/track/t-OYDlT2X4FTTp%252FR2KBg5Tzw%253D%253D.htm" data-url="https://www.2bulu.com/track/t-OYDlT2X4FTTp%252FR2KBg5Tzw%253D%253D.htm"><strong><span>点击将轨迹文件导入手表</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听指南：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这是一档为【边跑边听】而设计的播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>用声音为跑者导航，让故事与脚步同频</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 来到起点，戴上耳机</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 找到配速，欢迎使用倍速功能调节</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 若遇到红灯或需要休息，请暂停播放</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 建议早上或者工作日体验，人流更少，跑得更畅快</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 将轨迹文件导入运动手表，可以最大限度避免跑错</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>本期概览：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>距离：7.8KM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>配速：7′00″/KM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 跑前热身：收听及跑步提醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a> 跑步起点：红树林海滨生态公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a> 全国最小的自然保护区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a> 小游戏：暂停，找鸟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 观鸟和跑马拉松一样，都有点收集癖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> 十万只候鸟，在深圳湾越冬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 海韵园：园艺不只有审美视角，也有生态视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> 崇拜科技的时代，自然观察让时间慢下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> 不同的季节里，同一条路线也会有变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 自然的丰富度也来自人的保护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a> 北湾鹭港：无人机外卖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 潮汐变化间，动植物有自己的应对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3188">53:08</a> 草坪能不能踩，在设计之初就决定了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3309">55:09</a> 粤海街道：赚钱后怎么花，深圳湾是一个样板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3573">59:33</a> 变成植物、变成动物、变成小孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3705">1:01:45</a> 跑步终点：人才公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3743">1:02:23</a> 跑后拉伸：任宁在深圳湾的故事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>跑者互动：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>分享你因为跑步而熟悉的一棵树/一只鸟或是一个井盖？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作团队：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>制作人&amp;主持人：刘易非，《鹰眼时间》主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：幸倍</span></p><span></span><p><span>致谢</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FouJ_WUuY77_ggHtKP5LvHFgEr9y.png"></figure>]]></description>
