  <item>
    <title>深圳EP01 | 南山·好久不见周六野Zoey</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a154b4de29766da9bf9974</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a154b4de29766da9bf9974</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“深圳人都能跑赢创业这条路吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“和鹰赛跑是什么样的体验？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“为什么有了女儿之后，想要重新开始跑步？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们和配速员【健身博主· 周六野Zoey】一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>从深圳大学出发</span></p><span></span><p><span>途径深圳湾科技生态园、大沙河生态长廊</span></p><span></span><p><span>抵达深圳 On昂跑万象天地旗舰店</span></p><span></span><p><span>用【6分配】</span></p><span></span><p><span>跑过她的青春故事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm12A2v9OEntMIJ0xwLjRClOpN3X.png"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=nhgj%2BuloaDDp%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D" data-url="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=nhgj%2BuloaDDp%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D"><strong><span>点击将轨迹文件导入手表</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听指南：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这是一档为【边跑边听】而设计的播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>用声音为跑者导航，让故事与脚步同频</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 来到起点，戴上耳机</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 找到配速，欢迎使用倍速功能调节</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 若遇到红灯或需要休息，请暂停播放</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 建议早上或者工作日体验，人流更少，跑得更畅快</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期概览：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>距离：7KM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>配速：6′00″/KM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 跑前热身：收听及跑步提醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 起点地标：深大南地铁站</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">03:06</a> 南山也曾是“郊外”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 我是一个“跑偏”的理科生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> 健身，拯救柬埔寨创业失败的解药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 途径地标：深圳湾科技生态园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> “很多问题问得太早，先做就会有解答”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 途径地标：大沙河生态长廊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a> “运动不是一种兴趣，运动就像洗澡和吃饭”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 有了女儿之后，重新开始跑步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 跑步、铁三、冲浪，在自然中读懂自然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 途径地标：沙河西大冲人行天桥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> &nbsp;在巴拿马，和鹰展开一场追逐游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2271">37:51</a> “不用太push自己”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2551">42:31</a> 终点地标：On昂跑 深圳旗舰店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> 跑后拉伸：我们，没有理由不开心</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>跑者互动：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你是从什么时候开始喜欢上跑步？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作团队：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>制作人&amp;主持人：刘易非，《鹰眼时间》主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：幸倍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FouJ_WUuY77_ggHtKP5LvHFgEr9y.png"></figure>]]></description>
