    <title>上海EP03 | 梧桐区 · 跑进上海的甜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691aea72cbba038b42f24e5a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691aea72cbba038b42f24e5a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Nov 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“跑步和碳水是好朋友吗？”</span></p><p><span>“海派西餐到底是什么？”</span></p><p><span>“消失的味道需要被怀念吗？”</span></p><p><span>本期我们和配速员【美食作家· 陈宇慧（田螺姑娘）】一起</span></p><p><span>从静安寺广场出发</span></p><p><span>途径南京西路、淮海中路、复兴西路、华山路</span></p><p><span>最后回到静安寺附近</span></p><p><span>用【7分配】浅尝上海的有滋有味</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fia9i_eNfUzbjhMWepGFewVLn7mF.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>收听指南：</span></strong></p><p><span>这是一档为【边跑边听】而设计的播客</span></p><p><span>用声音为跑者导航，让故事与脚步同频</span></p><p><span>1. 来到起点，戴上耳机</span></p><p><span>2. 找到配速，欢迎使用倍速功能调节</span></p><p><span>3. 若遇到红灯或需要休息，请暂停播放</span></p><p><span>4. 建议早上或者工作日体验，人流更少，跑得更畅快</span></p><p><strong><span>本期概览：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>距离：6.5 KM</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>配速：7′00″/KM</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 跑前热身：收听及跑步提醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 跑步起点：静安寺广场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 上海早点：“四大金刚”的繁荣和时代性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">09:44</a> 陕西北路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="784">13:04</a> 跑步和碳水是好朋友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> 本帮菜也不都是浓油赤酱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1199">19:59</a> 淮海中路：曾经的上海餐饮兵家必争之地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">22:04</a> 复兴中路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">22:21</a> 海派西餐，融合之地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> 途经乌鲁木齐中路：网红与传统并存</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a> 华山路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2281">38:01</a> 海派西点：消失的味道需要被怀念吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2762">46:02</a> Bistro是如何在上海流行起来的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 跑步终点：延华园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2937">48:57</a> 跑后拉伸：陈宇慧的跑步故事</span></p><p><strong><span>跑者互动</span></strong></p><p><span>跑步后你最常光顾的小店是？我们将在小宇宙评论区抽取5位留言，送出限量On昂跑 鞋袋1个。</span></p><p><strong><span>制作团队</span></strong></p><p><span>制作人&amp;主持人：刘易非，《鹰眼时间》主播</span></p><p><span>后期：幸倍</span></p><p><span>顾问：wanying</span></p><p><strong><span>致谢</span></strong></p><p><span>路线图：</span><a href="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=VVWLD%2F%2FfdCTp%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D" data-url="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=VVWLD%2F%2FfdCTp%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D"><span>www.2bulu.com</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiyqQ5wbgRrok1y51B_zcMvp4lZ7.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
