  <item>
    <title>上海EP02 | 外滩 · 从1925跑到2025</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691ae90ecbba038b42f2020a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691ae90ecbba038b42f2020a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“上海最早的跑团是？”</span></p><p><span>“苏州河是如何从工业重镇变成跑者聚集地的？”</span></p><p><span>“什么造就了如此丰富的上海？”</span></p><p><span>本期我们和配速员【上海城市研究者·王越洲】一起</span></p><p><span>从外滩海关大楼出发</span></p><p><span>途径老城厢、南京路步行街、四行仓库、苏州河、乍浦路桥</span></p><p><span>最后回到海关大楼</span></p><p><span>用【6分配】丈量上海百年变迁</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiWoJPIagWB8fbhs7eG3CYZm_rcp.png"></figure><p><strong><span>收听指南：</span></strong></p><p><span>这是一档为【边跑边听】而设计的播客</span></p><p><span>用声音为跑者导航，让故事与脚步同频</span></p><p><span>1. 来到起点，戴上耳机</span></p><p><span>2. 找到配速，欢迎使用倍速功能调节</span></p><p><span>3. 若遇到红灯或需要休息，请暂停播放</span></p><p><span>4. 建议早上或者工作日体验，人流更少，跑得更畅快</span></p><p><strong><span>本期概览：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>距离：7.4 KM</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>配速：6′00″/KM</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 跑前热身：收听及跑步提醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 跑步起点：上海海关大楼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 外滩往事：上海开埠、情人墙、十六铺码头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> 老城厢：1930年代的路跑赛事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 虹白田径队、王正林，百年前的上海跑团与跑者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 洋泾浜&amp;福州路：上海路名的由来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 南京路步行街：四大百货的记忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">28:03</a> 新闸路&amp;四行仓库：上海也曾是江南水乡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a> 苏州河：从工业重镇到跑者聚集地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 河滨大楼&amp;邮政博物馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2418">40:18</a> 乍浦路桥：最佳出片点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a> 万国建筑博览群：什么造就了如此丰富的上海</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2778">46:18</a> 跑步终点：上海海关大楼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2797">46:37</a> 跑后拉伸：王越洲的跑步故事</span></p><p><strong><span>跑者互动：</span></strong></p><p><span>🕐你是从哪一年开始跑步的？我们将从小宇宙评论区抽取5位留言，送出限量On昂跑 鞋袋1个。</span></p><p><strong><span>制作团队</span></strong></p><p><span>制作人&amp;主持人：刘易非，《鹰眼时间》主播</span></p><p><span>后期：幸倍</span></p><p><span>顾问：wanying</span></p><p><strong><span>致谢</span></strong></p><p><span>路线图：</span><a href="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=5wZacAHw4RTp%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D" data-url="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=5wZacAHw4RTp%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D"><span>www.2bulu.com</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiyqQ5wbgRrok1y51B_zcMvp4lZ7.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
