    <title>上海EP01 | 西岸· 和姜思达重温心碎坡</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69171bae6018cc2c98d98b0b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69171bae6018cc2c98d98b0b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Nov 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“大众跑者，也是运动员吗？”</span></p><p><span>“从生活中挤时间跑步，如果挤不出来呢？”</span></p><p><span>“如果成绩终有极限，那跑者还有什么故事可以书写？”</span></p><p><span>本期我们和配速员【跑者·姜思达】一起</span></p><p><span>从龙美术馆出发</span></p><p><span>途径龙华港桥，西岸梦中心、龙华码头、进木港口</span></p><p><span>最后回到西岸梦中心</span></p><p><span>用【5分配】重温上海经典赛道「心碎坡」</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlEM2pT5wkhAbasYQ8Gkj3BTukxh.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>收听指南：</span></strong></p><p><span>这是一档为【边跑边听】而设计的播客</span></p><p><span>用声音为跑者导航，让故事与脚步同频</span></p><p><span>1. 来到起点，戴上耳机</span></p><p><span>2. 找到配速，欢迎使用倍速功能调节</span></p><p><span>3. 若遇到红灯或需要休息，请暂停播放</span></p><p><span>4. 建议早上或者工作日体验，人流更少，跑得更畅快</span></p><p><strong><span>本期概览：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>距离：10.1 KM</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>配速：5′00″/KM</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 跑前热身：收听及跑步提醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 跑步起点：龙美术馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 龙华港桥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 配速、爬升：比赛中能准备的和无法掌控的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 马拉松不是跑步的目的，也不是终点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a> 龙华机场&amp;西岸梦中心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> 严肃跑者的日常：从生活中挤时间跑步，如果挤不出来呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 龙华码头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 大众跑者，也是“运动员”吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 姜思达上海的前两次马拉松回忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 张家塘港桥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1638">27:18</a> 春申港桥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a> 严肃跑者是一群慕强的人吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a> 进木港口（折返点）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2121">35:21</a> 受伤之后，怎么忍受“不能跑”的状态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2329">38:49</a> 如果成绩终有极限，那跑者还有什么故事可以书写？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3174">52:54</a> 如果有不再跑步的一天</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3257">54:17</a> 跑步终点：On昂跑西岸跑者基地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3299">54:59</a> 跑后拉伸：姜思达的跑步故事</span></p><p><strong><span>跑者互动：</span></strong></p><p><span>你心里的“心碎坡”又在哪里呢？我们将抽取5位留言，送出限量On昂跑 鞋袋1个。</span></p><p><strong><span>制作团队</span></strong></p><p><span>制作人&amp;主持人：刘易非，《鹰眼时间》主播</span></p><p><span>后期：幸倍</span></p><p><span>顾问：wanying</span></p><p><strong><span>致谢</span></strong></p><p><span>路线图：</span><a href="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=jPgKYEeq0F7p%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D" data-url="https://www.2bulu.com/track/track_detail.htm?trackId=jPgKYEeq0F7p%2FR2KBg5Tzw%3D%3D"><span>www.2bulu.com</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiyqQ5wbgRrok1y51B_zcMvp4lZ7.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
